Drift: Discovery

Purpose:
  Define drift detection, conflict resolution, and source-to-.sdd
  mapping rules.

DriftTypes:
  STACK_DRIFT: .sdd stack differs from source
  ARCHITECTURE_DRIFT: .sdd architecture differs from source
  TASK_DRIFT: .sdd task status differs from source state
  DOC_DRIFT: .sdd documentation differs from source
  SECURITY_DRIFT: .sdd security controls differ from source
  TEST_DRIFT: .sdd test claims differ from source tests
  INFRA_DRIFT: .sdd infrastructure differs from source
  DECISION_DRIFT: .sdd decisions differ from source implementation

ConflictResolution:
  Principle: Analyze ? Modify

  Process:
    DETECT
      ?
    REPORT
      ?
    HUMAN/AGENT DECISION
      ?
    .sdd UPDATE (if approved)

ConflictReporting:
  Format:
    Conflict: <DRIFT_TYPE>
    .sdd: <what .sdd claims>
    Source: <what source shows>
    Evidence: <list of indicators>
    Recommendation: <suggested resolution>

Mapping:
  Source: ./<layer>/<domain>/<module>/<artifact>
  ? Task: .sdd/projects/{project_name}/tasks/<TASK-ID>.sdd
  ? Domain: <domain-name>
  ? Component: <ComponentName>
  ? Skill: <skill-name>
  ? Test: <test-path>
  ? Doc: docs/<layer>/<domain>.md

DriftExamples:
  STACK_DRIFT: .sdd says Redis, source has Redis + Memcached
  ARCHITECTURE_DRIFT: .sdd says Modular Monolith, source shows microservices
  TASK_DRIFT: Task marked DONE but source shows incomplete
  DOC_DRIFT: Doc says PostgreSQL sessions, source uses Redis
  SECURITY_DRIFT: .sdd has rate limiting, source does not
  TEST_DRIFT: .sdd claims E2E tests, none found
  INFRA_DRIFT: .sdd says AWS, source uses VPS
  DECISION_DRIFT: DEC-017 says Redis, source uses Memcached

Rules:
  [CO1] Discovery MUST detect all drift types.
  [CO2] Discovery MUST report conflicts, not fix them.
  [CO3] Discovery MUST provide evidence for each conflict.
  [CO4] Discovery MUST recommend resolution, not enforce it.
  [CO5] .sdd MUST NOT be modified without explicit decision.
  [MP1] Every source file SHOULD map to a task or component.
  [MP2] Every domain SHOULD have documentation.
  [MP3] Every security control SHOULD be documented.
  [MP4] Drift MUST be reported, not silently ignored.

State: +
